{
    "title": "Game of Words: Word Puzzles",
    "description": "Train your brain with an addictive word puzzle game that combines word search with a word scramble twist. Game of Words offers over 10,000 levels of free word games for adults and younger players alike looking for brain training, to improve vocabulary, or to simply relax and unwind.\r\n\r\n<b>Relaxing yet challenging word puzzles</b>\r\n\r\nPut both your spelling and grammar ability to the test. Use letter tiles to connect words and solve the puzzles - beginning with simple word scrambles and progressing to puzzles containing 8-letter words, you\u2019ll soon find yourself focused and relaxed.\r\n\r\n<b>Grammar mini-games</b>\r\n\r\nAlongside challenging word puzzles, Game of Words includes grammar mini-games to really put your English ability to the test. Reach level 4 to unlock the first grammar challenge!\r\n\r\n<b>Earn and upgrade </b>\r\n\r\nAs you progress, you\u2019ll earn rewards, build and improve a home, explore relaxing landscapes, and even meet your own pets! Game of Words can be played with or without additions, however, so if you simply want to focus on beating the game, that\u2019s entirely up to you! \r\n\r\n\u25baSimply swipe from the letter jumble to find a word.\r\n\u25baPut your word hunt ability to the test and find all words to complete a level. \r\n\u25baChallenge your brain! Test your vocabulary with increasingly challenging word games.\r\n\r\nThis is the perfect fit for fans of word connect and word search games. Although Game of Words starts easy it soon gets tough, and with millions of downloads globally it ranks among one of the top word games for adults. Start your word hunt now and delve into an addictive word puzzle game experience!\r\n\r\nHave an issue or would like support? Please contact us at support@dreamloftgames.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Train your brain with an addictive word puzzle game that combines word search with a word scramble twist. Game of Words offers over 10,000 levels of free word games for adults and younger players alike looking for brain training, to improve vocabulary, or to simply relax and unwind.<br><br><b>Relaxing yet challenging word puzzles</b><br><br>Put both your spelling and grammar ability to the test. Use letter tiles to connect words and solve the puzzles - beginning with simple word scrambles and progressing to puzzles containing 8-letter words, you\u2019ll soon find yourself focused and relaxed.<br><br><b>Grammar mini-games</b><br><br>Alongside challenging word puzzles, Game of Words includes grammar mini-games to really put your English ability to the test. Reach level 4 to unlock the first grammar challenge!<br><br><b>Earn and upgrade </b><br><br>As you progress, you\u2019ll earn rewards, build and improve a home, explore relaxing landscapes, and even meet your own pets! Game of Words can be played with or without additions, however, so if you simply want to focus on beating the game, that\u2019s entirely up to you! <br><br>\u25baSimply swipe from the letter jumble to find a word.<br>\u25baPut your word hunt ability to the test and find all words to complete a level. <br>\u25baChallenge your brain! Test your vocabulary with increasingly challenging word games.<br><br>This is the perfect fit for fans of word connect and word search games. Although Game of Words starts easy it soon gets tough, and with millions of downloads globally it ranks among one of the top word games for adults. Start your word hunt now and delve into an addictive word puzzle game experience!<br><br>Have an issue or would like support? Please contact us at support@dreamloftgames.com.",
